    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Some container formats, such as QuickTime movies, support writing movies in fragments.",
      "ko": "아래 그림은 얼굴 기하 구조([`ARSCNFaceGeometry`](arscnfacegeometry.md))의 두 상태를 보여주며, 이 계수에 대해 `0.0`과 `1.0` 값을 표시합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a1930c3499a205a8ad6c7f20e0981c33ce4f75019552a9658e0aa2a38dc87987",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Using this feature enables you to open and play a partially written movie in the event that an unexpected error or interruption occurs.",
      "ko": "두 상태 모두에서 다른 [`ARFaceAnchor.BlendShapeLocation`](arfaceanchor/blendshapelocation.md) 계수의 값은 `0.0`으로 설정됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2d8d46cea6b9bf842e4bdb0fd9a83c0eeb068d858ae057a6005e01ebfd244cb7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "An asset writer disables this feature by default and sets this value to [`invalid`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/invalid).",
      "ko": "![None](https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/12b6bc86e2a90f4ade7c069ac69d5842/media-2930073%402x.png)",
      "sourceHash": "a9a670d138e91b8cec1116344b61093c27a6198eecbb05dc5ef130306c21f3f3",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "To enable fragment writing, set a valid [`CMTime`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime) value.",
      "ko": "To enable fragment writing, set a valid [`CMTime`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime) value.",
      "sourceHash": "b9624e7b957b42dfea9abd53a8e071b9f6f6933982ed3260dba909d09737c5bc",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0003",
      "source": "For best performance when writing to external storage devices, set the movie fragment interval to 10 seconds or greater.",
      "ko": "For best performance when writing to external storage devices, set the movie fragment interval to 10 seconds or greater.",
      "sourceHash": "65698757433cdec22b72c95a152a6103b5a60780156df257f4f266b8be29cd68",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "You can’t set this value after writing starts.",
      "ko": "You can’t set this value after writing starts.",
      "sourceHash": "93a0db5daa679250f6ef1951e0bd91e880108676bdb6f79424ef3b90624e6ee7",
      "status": "failed"
    },
